{"id":1788214,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-05T19:53:12.309Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1788214,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["RU"],"original_language":"ru","original_title":"Секретная система недопонимания","overview":"The film is based on the drawings and graphic illustrations taken from the patent “Secret Communication System”, registered as US2292387. When work on radio-controlled torpedoes began in the early 1940s, it became clear that an enemy would have little trouble intercepting the frequency of a control signal. In 1942, to fix that problem, the film actress Hedy Lamarr and the composer George Antheil proposed changing the carrier frequency of transmitter and receiver by means of a perforated paper tape, of the kind used in a player piano. Lamarr and Antheil’s invention folded musical logic into the mechanics of war, fulfilling the modernist utopia’s hope that art and technological progress might pass into one another.","popularity":0.0143,"poster_path":"/jP3EZXLrrnVPFRsH1vfj6hiSKV0.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Russia"}],"release_date":"2026-10-17","revenue":0,"runtime":9,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Russian","iso_639_1":"ru","name":"Pусский"}],"status":"In Production","tagline":"","title":"Secret [Mis]communication System","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"RU","title":"Sekretnaya sistema nedoponimaniya","type":"Transliteration"}]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2808331,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Nikita Spiridonov","original_name":"Никита Спиридонов","popularity":0.5973,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ac260a70757e032db324882","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2808331,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Nikita Spir